==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|skilja}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*skiljaną}}, from {{inh|is|ine-pro|*(s)kelH-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈscɪlja/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɪlja|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|skildi|skilið}}

# {{lb|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[separate]]
# {{lb|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[understand]]
#: {{ux|is|[[ég skil ekki|Ég '''skil''' ekki]].|[[I don't understand|I don't '''understand''']].}}
#: {{ux|is|Fyrirgefðu, en ég '''skil''' ekki frönsku.|I'm sorry but I don't '''understand''' French.}}
# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[divorce]]

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-w1|sk|i|l|j=j}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|separate}} {{l|is|aðskilja}}
* {{sense|understand}} {{l|is|botna í}}, {{l|is|sjá}}, {{l|is|undirstanda}} (''obsolete'')
* {{sense|divorce}} {{l|is|slíta sambúð}}

====Derived terms====
